#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Command Gateway Node for Valid8 Dual UR5e Cell — NVIDIA cuRobo Backend

Replaces MoveIt2 with NVIDIA cuRobo for GPU-accelerated:
  - Inverse kinematics  (IKSolver on CUDA)
  - Motion planning     (MotionGen — trajectory optimization on CUDA)
  - Collision checking  (signed distance fields on CUDA)

cuRobo produces inherently smooth, minimum-jerk, time-optimal
trajectories.  No additional retiming or velocity-profile shaping
is needed (the old MoveIt gateway required 200+ lines of cosine-
blended retiming to avoid jerkiness).

WebSocket protocol is 100% compatible with simforge_client.
"""

